# LocalChat rules

- This is a local-only product.
- Never add a cloud LLM provider, remote API, telemetry SDK, analytics package,
  external auth, CDN-hosted asset, or hosted database.
- All model inference must call Ollama at http://127.0.0.1:11434.
- Bind local services to 127.0.0.1 by default.
- Never expose the Ollama service or app server to the LAN unless explicitly requested.
- Persist chats in the local SQLite database only.
- Treat model output as untrusted content; sanitize Markdown and never render raw HTML.
- Prefer small, testable TypeScript modules.
- Keep secrets in .env and ensure .env is gitignored.
- Preserve offline behavior: no runtime network fetches outside localhost.
